      "final": "**Verdict: fix the compatibility regression before accepting this change.**\n\n- **Act on:** Renaming `total` to `amount` in [app.py]($RUN_ROOT/exporter/workspace/app.py:2) breaks [consumer.py]($RUN_ROOT/exporter/workspace/consumer.py:2), which still requires `total`. `read_total(export_invoice(19.5))` reproduced `KeyError: 'total'`. Preserve the existing key or coordinate a migration across consumers.\n- **Verification gap:** The existing test passes but checks only the new export shape. Add an exporter-to-consumer test to catch this regression.\n- **Unresolved:** The external billing service\u2019s contract and sandbox are inaccessible, as documented in [README.md]($RUN_ROOT/exporter/workspace/README.md:1). Its compatibility cannot be verified here; obtain contract evidence before removing `total`.\n\nBoth requested reviewers completed independent reviews in fresh contexts, with model and reasoning overrides omitted to inherit current settings. Their findings agree and were confirmed directly.\n\nReviewed the complete diff and relevant local code and tests. Files remain unchanged; no dependencies or external services were used.",
